---
title: Listing and trip state machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> draft
    draft --> pending_review: host submits
    pending_review --> published: admin approves
    pending_review --> changes_requested: admin
    pending_review --> rejected: admin with reason
    pending_review --> draft: host withdraws
    changes_requested --> pending_review: host resubmits
    rejected --> draft: host edits
    published --> paused: host
    paused --> published: host
    published --> archived: host
    archived --> draft: host
    published --> suspended: admin with reason
    published --> changes_requested: admin
    suspended --> published: admin
    suspended --> rejected: admin
    draft --> deleted: soft delete
    published --> deleted: soft delete
    deleted --> [*]
